  <entry level="3" title="惡寒發熱　陰陽二氣相乘勝病也。成無己《明理論》云：" first-seg="KR3er109_jc_014-d16.d2.d4.h1s1" last-seg="KR3er109_jc_014-d16.d2.d4.p2s273"/>
  <entry level="3" title="痼冷　寒邪久伏病也。凡人或冒雨雪，或涉冰淵，" first-seg="KR3er109_jc_014-d16.d2.d5.h1s1" last-seg="KR3er109_jc_014-d16.d2.d5.p2s110"/>
  <entry level="3" title="寒厥暴亡　亦積寒病也。" first-seg="KR3er109_jc_014-d16.d2.d6.h1s1" last-seg="KR3er109_jc_014-d16.d2.d6.p2s743"/>
